{"nodeId":"kp:21330","contents":[{"id":"lesson-content:book3:L063:surface-classification","nodeId":"kp:21330","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"method_application","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"按共面两直线位置分情况认识圆柱面和圆锥面","scope":"L063相应具体问题或教学活动；此范围说明为编辑文字","blocks":[{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"与旋转体类似地可以定义空间中的旋转面：一条平面曲线（包括直线、折线等）绕其所在平面上的一条直线旋转一周所形成的空间图形称为旋转面．如图中右边的空间几何体的表面就是旋转面，它可由左边对应平面图形的外框线绕旋转轴旋转而得到．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para119:surface-classification:0"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"对于旋转面，我们来研究比较简单的情况，请大家思考．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para121:surface-classification:1"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"[问题6] 一条直线绕同一平面内的另一条直线旋转一周形成怎样的曲面？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para122:surface-classification:2"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"根据旋转体的定义：一个平面封闭图形绕其所在平面上的一条定直线旋转一周所形成的空间封闭几何体，根据同一平面内两直线的位置关系有平行或者相交，要分这两种情况进行讨论．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para123:surface-classification:3"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"当直线$a$与直线$l$平行时，直线$a$绕直线$l$旋转一周形成的曲面可以与哪个旋转体联系？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para124:surface-classification:4"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"矩形绕一边所在直线旋转成圆柱；矩形两组对边互相平行，所以$a\\parallel l$时，$a$绕$l$的曲面可与圆柱联系。","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para125:surface-classification:5"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"我们来观察它的形成过程（几何画板动画演示），刚刚这位同学说的没错，形成的曲面可与圆柱联系起来，我们把这个曲面叫做圆柱面． ","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para126:surface-classification:6"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"当直线$a$与$l$相交但不垂直时，$a$绕$l$旋转一周形成的曲面可与哪个旋转体联系？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para127:surface-classification:7"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"直角三角形绕一条直角边所在直线旋转成圆锥，所以$a$与$l$相交但不垂直时，所得曲面可与圆锥联系。","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para128:surface-classification:8"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"同样的，我们观察它的形成过程（几何画板动画演示），我们把这个曲面叫做圆锥面．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para129:surface-classification:9"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"两种情况已经讨论完毕；直线$a$称为圆柱面或圆锥面的母线。圆锥面中，母线与转轴交点$O$旋转后仍是点$O$，称为圆锥面的顶点。","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L063:para130:surface-classification:10"]}],"contentOrigin":"source_supported_editorial_summary","wordingStatus":"教案有源整理与数学转写，非逐字引用","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"该具体任务与既有节点对应"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book3:L063:para119:surface-classification:0","sourceId":"L063","sourceSha256":"efa202446fceb272820e10b521e99385c376344c0e3b3dea1869d092c9b27f07","locator":{"headingPath":["按共面两直线位置分情况认识圆柱面和圆锥面"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":119,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":8,"printedPage":8,"pdfPage":8,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"与旋转体类似地可以定义空间中的旋转面：一条平面曲线（包括直线、折线等）绕其所在平面上的一条直线旋转一周所形成的空间图形称为旋转面．如图中右边的空间几何体的表面就是旋转面，它可由左边对应平面图形的外框线绕旋转轴旋转而得到．","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L063","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l064-v1/evidence/L063/page-8.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L063.docx","sourceTitle":"11.3多面体与旋转体 教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book3:L063:para121:surface-classification:1","sourceId":"L063","sourceSha256":"efa202446fceb272820e10b521e99385c376344c0e3b3dea1869d092c9b27f07","locator":{"headingPath":["按共面两直线位置分情况认识圆柱面和圆锥面"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":121,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":9,"printedPage":9,"pdfPage":9,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"对于旋转面，我们来研究比较简单的情况，请大家思考．","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L063","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l064-v1/evidence/L063/page-9.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"origina